    <guid isPermaLink="false">699afd49de29766da9288692</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 13:10:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期播客再次有幸请到了夏老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们因为国庆相亲高峰期槽点太多聚到一起，延伸聊到每个人的亲密关系现状和感情观，一直拖延直到春节再一个相亲小高峰发出来，刚好也许能让也在追寻亲密关系的你聊以慰藉。</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 开场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 夏老师当伴娘的经历</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 畸形的相亲市场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 充满着妥协的亲密关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 婚姻带来了什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> 论如何选择伴侣</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Music: enchanted wanderer by linear ring</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目网站：</span><a href="https://turbulentinsights.com/" data-url="https://turbulentinsights.com/"><span>turbulentinsights.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在小宇宙、Apple Podcasts 和各泛用型播客客户端（如 Pocket Casts、Overcast）订阅我们的节目。</span></p>]]></description>
