  <item>
    <title>EP06 DLC：一方人跟一方水土的和解</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f2a595e490c5dee51e9f4f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f2a595e490c5dee51e9f4f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Sep 2023 03:01:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>兜兜转转又回到小城市，但这次我们能抽离出来看待：是怎样的环境滋养着我们，我们如何感受、如何适应。本期节目是城市之间的小城市特辑，其实最开始并没有这集的规划，只是活着活着溢出了 mean 言 mean 语。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 开场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 介绍这座小城市</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 小城市人的娱乐活动：麻将</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 找熟人是小城市的生存法则</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2456">40:56</a> 小城消费心理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a> 小城社交局</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3339">55:39</a> 小城市的下一代</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Music: enchanted love (and the witch's selfish heart) by linear ring</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目网站：<a data-url="https://turbulentinsights.com/" href="https://turbulentinsights.com/">turbulentinsights.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>播客与播客客户端的介绍：<a data-url="https://turbulentinsights.com/posts/podcast-clients" href="https://turbulentinsights.com/posts/podcast-clients">turbulentinsights.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
