    <pubDate>Thu, 04 May 2023 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://zh.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%82%81%E7%88%BE%E6%96%AF-%E5%B8%83%E9%87%8C%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%AF%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%88%86%E9%A1%9E%E6%B3%95" data-url="https://zh.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%82%81%E7%88%BE%E6%96%AF-%E5%B8%83%E9%87%8C%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%AF%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%88%86%E9%A1%9E%E6%B3%95"><span>MBTI</span></a><span> 近年来一直保持着很高的话题度，最近一位博主的 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/av442095389" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/av442095389"><span>i</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/av909930724" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/av909930724"><span>e</span></a><span> 人 KTV 视频由于其过于强烈的对比，又一次掀起讨论热潮。我们试图以此为契机，交流一下各自对 MBTI 的看法。</span></p><p><span>剧透：本期节目您将收听到 40 分钟的争论（吵架）。</span></p><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><ul><li><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 开场</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 前段时间很火的「E 人聚会」</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 「自报家门」</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 对 MBTI 的总体态度</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> MBTI 为什么这么火</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> MBTI 的一些「bug」</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> MBTI 与人际关系</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a> MBTI 与「具体的人」</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 顺便聊聊星座</span></p></li></ul><p><span>Music: Not Cool But Cole by PETO</span></p><p><span>节目网站：<a data-url="https://turbulentinsights.com/" href="https://turbulentinsights.com/">turbulentinsights.com</a></span></p><p><span>播客与播客客户端的介绍：<a data-url="https://turbulentinsights.com/posts/podcast-clients" href="https://turbulentinsights.com/posts/podcast-clients">turbulentinsights.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
